### Avatar Upload API Tests

### Register a user for testing
POST https://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "avataruser",
    "password": "Test123@"
}

###

### Login to get JWT token
POST https://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "avataruser",
    "password": "Test123@"
}

###

### Get user profile before avatar upload
GET https://localhost:3000/user/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Upload avatar (JPG file)
POST https://localhost:3000/user/upload-avatar
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="avatar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test_files/avatar.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

